ced\",\"k8s/audit-maintenance.yaml:26\",\"psql@sha256:9b2e61c04d7f3a85\",\"Literal digest.\"),\n  row(\"Dockerfile build base\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:2\",\"@sha256:032c52613401895a\",\"Digest pinned.\"),\n  row(\"Dockerfile runtime base\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:8\",\"@sha256:7e4c1d2a9f3b8e60\",\"Digest pinned.\")])\ncheck(\"B10.2\",\"yes\",f\"{AD}:48\",'subject: \"https://github.com/acme/hr-helpdesk-agent/.github/workflows/release.yml@refs/heads/main\"',\"Keyless verification pins an exact workflow subject and issuer with no regex.\",\n counter=\"Searched admission.yaml for subjectRegExp, issuerRegExp and .*: none.\",\n rows=[row(\"agent image subject\",\"enforced\",f\"{AD}:48\",\"release.yml@refs/heads/main\",\"Exact subject.\"),\n  row(\"agent image issuer\",\"enforced\",f\"{AD}:49\",'issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"',\"Exact issuer.\"),\n  row(\"platform image subject\",\"enforced\",f\"{AD}:79\",\"build.yml@refs/heads/main\",\"Exact subject.\"),\n  row(\"platform image issuer\",\"enforced\",f\"{AD}:80\",'issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"',\"Exact issuer.\")])\ncheck(\"B10.3\",\"no\",f\"{AD}:72\",'- imageReferences: [\"registry.acme.example/platform/*\"]',\"The platform/* rule (used by the maintenance job image in hr-agent) verifies a signature only and has no attestations block, so builder, source repository, build type and externalParameters are not compared for it.\",\n counter=\"Read both verifyImages entries: the agent image entry has full conditions at admission.yaml:58-71; the platform entry has none.\")\ncheck(\"B10.4\",\"no\",f\"{AD}:35\",'- image: \"registry.acme.example/*@sha256:*\"',\"Enforce and failurePolicy Fail cover hr-agent, but the registry rule accepts any digest-pinned image from registry.acme.example while verifyImages only matches two path prefixes, so an unsigned image from any other path is admitted.\",\n counter=\"Searched for a deny rule for images matching no verifyImages entry: none.\